    <markdownProperty name="description" category="detail"><![CDATA[A member cannot have more than five non-cancelled bookings in the same week or two non-cancelled bookings that start at the same time:

```
context Member inv MaximumWeeklyBookings:
  self.bookings->select(b | b.status <> BookingStatus::CANCELLED)
    ->forAll(b | self.bookings->select(c | c.status <> BookingStatus::CANCELLED
      and c.date.week() = b.date.week())->size() <= 5)
```]]></markdownProperty>
